  "label": "Lesbian Sexuality Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on a derogatory stereotype that reduces lesbian sexual activity to a simplistic, animalistic metaphor, implying it is primitive or instinctual. This stereotype is part of broader LGBTQ+ discrimination and is used to demean and mock lesbians by associating their sexuality with feline behavior, which is presented as crude and vulgar.",
